    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Kaelvorrin is centered at 6.383293, 5.827743 under Consensus Democracy, with 133,180,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Kaelvorrin occupies 5,610,032.72 sq mi / 14,529,918.04 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 2.848636% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Farming, Partial forest and Grassland define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Farming and Partial forest. Population density is 9.166 people/sq km / 23.740 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, and 1 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Harengon, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Brass Concordat, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Marduthor, Raeshkul, Bastveig, Sigrananna, and 3 more.",
      "groupLinkDescription": "The province participates in 7 recorded four-province geography group links, including 5 cross-transportation-group links. These links place it inside overlapping regional corridors rather than one isolated block, allowing border-adjacent transit, faction influence, and cultural spillover to breathe across group lines.",
